# Keeps the build context of `playwright.Dockerfile` small (.github/workflows/playwright-image.yml and
# `mise run prepare:playwright` build it from the repository root).
# That file has no COPY or ADD, so a local podman never reads this list for that build;
# a remote podman client (podman machine, CONTAINER_HOST) tars the whole context minus these patterns
# and uploads it before any instruction runs.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.jj
bak
.bak
*.tsbuildinfo
*.map
test-results
playwright-report
.cache
**/cache
*.log
*.log.jsonl
*.tmp
.tmp
.tmp*
.idea
.vscode
coverage
*.lcov
